  "stem": "A police jeep moving at a constant speed v is chasing a dacoit on a motorcycle. When the jeep is a distance $x$ behind, the dacoit starts from rest with a constant acceleration α. Which of the following relations must hold if the police are to catch the dacoit?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$v^{2} \\leq \\alpha x$",
    "B": "$v^{2} \\leq 2\\alpha x$",
    "C": "$v^{2} \\geq 2\\alpha x$",
    "D": "$v^{2} \\geq \\alpha x$"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "C"
    ]
  },
